    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "## My Favorites\n#### This web app uses an array to :\n- #### list 3 favorite things\n- #### select a favorite\n- #### count the number of favorites\n\n#### Let's take a look at how to do this in JavaScript. ",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/275f4d172781cd2d948be17a4e578820-1Panel Levels AIF U3.png",
        "key": "pl-aif-2-U3-array-syntax-panel-2-ec7990d2-db82-489f-a490-b16a3912529d"
      },
      {
        "text": "## What is an Array?\n-  #### An **Array** is a list of items stored in a single variable.\n-  #### Each item has a position number called an **index.**\n-  #### Indexes start at 0, not 1",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/e78ffb8442d0d8880770f1e8994945a9-_Panel Levels AIF U3.png",
        "key": "undefined-ea03636a-a1b5-4568-be2b-86c3c6462665",
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Declaring an Array\n- #### Declaring an array means creating a variable that holds a list of items.\n- #### We use square brackets [] to show that it’s an array.\n-  #### Each item inside the brackets is separated by a comma.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/143d16d00ab9b9a0795c2cb36111db29-_Panel Levels AIF U3.png",
        "key": "pl-aif-2-U3-array-syntax-panel-2-2d7789a3-15d7-4338-a161-92ef18d852eb",
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Getting Element IDs and Indexes\n- #### First, find the HTML element by its id.\n- #### Then, set the text to the matching array item.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/02115696c06f86480060c705c21f1317-44Panel Levels AIF U3.png",
        "key": "pl-aif-2-U3-array-syntax-panel-2-7a441f84-3f92-4528-bf01-04db6f27c62f",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Using the Index to Display Items\n#### Here, you can see how the element ids and indexes are used to display the list.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/74a01c6872b5c879f87736f2ecf083d3-5Panel Levels AIF U3.png",
        "key": "pl-aif-2-U3-array-syntax-panel-2-f091b8a4-4169-414c-b738-0c55dcf32902",
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "text": "## .length\n #### is a built-in property that tells you how many items are in the array. ",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/69221c5e04602b5f40f7b141d0a22805-6Panel Levels AIF U3.png",
        "key": "pl-aif-2-U3-array-syntax-panel-2-0f50b86c-5a33-4cc1-9030-76362997334a",
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Now Try!\n#### In the next level, use AI to help create a favorites app with an array. ",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/f97cc396091b1968bd4c24ddb6bf8ab4-8Panel Levels AIF U3.png",
        "key": "pl-aif-2-U3-array-syntax-panel-2-8bcc340c-f718-43f8-a3b6-e5b533883ec3",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      }
    ]
  },
